# Mosquitto ACL：按用户隔离 topic（防越权）
# 服务端用户：可给所有设备下发灯效，订阅所有设备遥测
user wingedhorse
topic write devices/#
topic write lamp-001/#
topic write #
topic read devices/+/telemetry
topic read +/telemetry
topic read +/data
topic read devices/+/data

# 设备用户（每台设备单独建一条）：只订阅自己的灯效、只发布自己的遥测
user lamp-001
topic read devices/lamp-001/effect
topic read lamp-001/effect
topic read lamp-001/cmd
topic read lamp-001
topic write devices/lamp-001/telemetry
topic write lamp-001/telemetry
topic write lamp-001/data
topic write devices/lamp-001/data
